--TEST--
`Core\Router::url` substitutes a computed value outside a capture's closed set rather than throwing, and encodes it into its own segment — `rule:routing/a-capture-narrows-to-a-closed-set` and `rule:routing/an-absolute-link-takes-a-configured-origin`
--FILE--
<?nvs
// The other side of `E0772`: a *literal* out-of-set value is a compile error
// (`reject/a-route-link-refuses-a-capture-value-outside-its-closed-set.nvst`),
// and a computed one is not checked at all — the closed set is the handler's
// declared type and a prepared template carries § 2's path pieces and no type.
// `crates/nvs-stdlib/src/router.rs`'s `substitute` owns why that is a
// substitution rather than a throw: an out-of-set segment is a request that
// does not match, so what a bad link produces is a `404` and not an error.
class Docs {
    // `rule:attributes/access-is-a-required-sibling`: the decision is a required sibling of every `#[Route]`.
    #[Core\Route(path: "/{lang}/docs/{page}", method: Core\Http\Method::Get, name: "docs.show")]
    #[Core\Access(allow: Core\Audience::Public)]
    public function show("en"|"de"|"fr" $lang, string $page): string { return $lang . "/" . $page; }
}

// Held in a variable, which is the whole difference between this and the
// compile error: § 5's check reads what the call site wrote.
var $lang = "xx";
echo "built=", Core\Router::url("docs.show", ["lang" => $lang, "page" => "intro"]), "\n";

// It threw nothing, asserted rather than implied — a member that grew a runtime
// set check would take this branch instead.
var $outcome = "built";
try {
    Core\Router::url("docs.show", ["lang" => $lang, "page" => "intro"]);
} catch (RuntimeError $e) {
    $outcome = "threw";
}
echo "outcome=", $outcome, "\n";

// § 4's launder is unchanged by any of it: the value still cannot climb out of
// its segment, so a bad link is a dead URL and never a path traversal.
var $hostile = "../../etc";
echo "encoded=", Core\Router::url("docs.show", ["lang" => $hostile, "page" => "intro"]), "\n";
--EXPECT--
built=/xx/docs/intro
outcome=built
encoded=/..%2F..%2Fetc/docs/intro
